"value":3,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4777190","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4281650-1847286114034101","game_id":"steam-4281650","kind":"update","title":"DEMO UPDATE: Spectating, Difficulty Tweaks, Bugfixes","summary":"Hi folks, Quick update. I've pushed a new patch with a couple new features, and bugfixes. Here's what's new: - SPECTATOR MODE: People were saying that it was a big boring when you are downed and can't do anything until a friend comes to help. So, I've added SPECTATOR MODE. Now, you can toggle between following different players while you are downed. Don't worry, you can still HONK when you are spectating to make sure they come revive you. - DIFFICULTY TWEAKS: Some people complained that it was a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T20:27:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034101","verified_at":"2026-10-22T20:30:01Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4281650-1847286114029887","game_id":"steam-4281650","kind":"announcement","title":"LIVESTREAM TONIGHT + Chinese Language Support","summary":"Hi all, Some important announcements! First, tonight we are doing another livestream at 7:30EST (Wednesday October 21) for Next Fest! Come hang with us and ask questions about the game. Second, we have released a new DEMO update with the following features: - Full chinese language support. The steam page should be translated as well. Simplified Chinese is one of the most common languages on steam, so we are excited to welcome new players! More languages coming soon. - We added a new option to th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:06:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029887","verified_at":"2026-10-21T22:45:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4281650-1846651706690702","game_id":"steam-4281650","kind":"announcement","title":"NEXT FEST is here!","summary":"Hey folks! Steam Next Fest is here! Throughout the festival, we will be doing some live streams, playing coop together. The best way to discover the game is by just seeing it played! The first live stream will be TONIGHT (October 19) at 7:30PM EST. I will probably do some casual solo streaming too just to make sure the wires are all connected. Come join the fun, download the demo and join our open party! If you want to support the game, the BEST thing you can do? Find some friends, hop into a ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:09:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690702","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4281650-1846651706681284","game_id":"steam-4281650","kind":"announcement","title":"New Name + New Co-op Demo + Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hey folks!It's been a few months since my last update, and a LOT has changed. I've been hard at work making the game bigger, better, and closer to its final form.Here's what's new:A New Name, Same Gnomes!First things first: Gnomads is now Long Way Gnome!Due to a trademark conflict, I had to say goodbye to the old name. But I think the new one fits the game better anyways!Hit the Road With Friends!Long Way Gnome now supports online co-op with up to 4 players!Team up with friends, build ridiculous","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:28:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681284","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4281650-1836506165556814","game_id":"steam-4281650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Bugfixes & Addressing Your Feedback!","summary":"Hey folks! The latest demo patch is out. After an amazing two weeks of feedback from the community, this patch aims to address a lot of bugs, gameplay improvements, and polish items. There will be more demo updates coming soon! As the game develops, I plan to keep updating the demo with rotating content, characters, enemies, and even levels leading up to the games launch later this year. Stay tuned. Here's what's new in this build: - Fix some crates and shops spawning on top of each other, makin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-27T16:42:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165556814","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4281650-1835871199307772","game_id":"steam-4281650","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: It's Trickin' Time!","summary":"Hey folks! The first big demo patch is here (only one week after launch!) So far, the feedback has been great, so please keep it coming! You can share your feedback by joining our discord or drop some feedback here What's new: - TRICKS! That's right, the most requested feature has been added, TRICKS. These work similarly to Mario kart, where each direction does a different trick, granting a small boost when you land. I've added a pretty high degree of aerial control here too. This feature is pre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T17:05:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199307772","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4281650-1835236783564229","game_id":"steam-4281650","kind":"announcement","title":"Gnomads Demo: Now Available!","summary":"The Gnomads demo is NOW AVAILABLE! Featuring: - 30 unique items to discover - 4 characters with unique abilities. - 10 weapons - The games first level of the game, Skidrock Canyon. - 4 enemy types and a giant beholder boss. Come play, and please don't hesitate to share your feedback by joining our discord and once you play, please drop some feedback here There will be updates and new content dropping in the demo over the next couple weeks, as well as a new trailer and steam page revamp next week","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T17:22:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783564229","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4281650-1834602721191093","game_id":"steam-4281650","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Launches June 12!","summary":"The demo for Gnomads launches on June 12!You’ll be able to hop in on June to play the first level of the game and try to beat the boss!What’s in the demo:Desert map + boss with tons of replayability4 unlockable characters30 unique items to collect10 weapons to discoverController + steam deck supportWishlist the game now so you don’t miss it, and come back on June 12 to play the demo.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-05T14:58:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721191093","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:22:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4281650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:55Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:47:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4281650":"2026-10-26T11:47:55Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4281650":{"last_attempt_at":"